WEBVTT

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:01.350
What can I do?

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:04.866
And I'm telling you, you can be color brave.

00:10:04.866 --> 00:10:06.750
If you're part of a hiring process

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.390
or an admissions process,

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:10.057
you can be color brave.

00:10:10.057 --> 00:10:12.901
If you are trying to solve a really hard problem,

00:10:12.901 --> 00:10:15.680
you can speak up and be color brave.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.929
Now I know people will say,

00:10:18.929 --> 00:10:21.079
but that doesn't add up to a lot,

00:10:21.079 --> 00:10:24.050
but I'm actually asking you
to do something really simple:

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:26.268
observe your environment,

00:10:26.268 --> 00:10:30.070
at work, at school, at home.